 "source": "debbie.mp4",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.031,
   "end": 18.788,
   "text": "was just toxic altogether it still hurt i still felt lost i still felt like a piece of me was cut off like you said you sold me yeah now i love that you've made it your mission to show people the way that you took out you found a path to the other side"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.993,
   "end": 24.135,
   "text": "I don't think you realize how many people don't make it across that."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.735,
   "end": 26.296,
   "text": "It just gets stuck."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.616,
   "end": 33.22,
   "text": "And I want your story to speak to these people that are stuck in these moments or stuck in this past."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.34,
   "end": 37.042,
   "text": "How did you find your way to forgiveness?"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.282,
   "end": 40.424,
   "text": "I know that's not in the script here, but that's coming from my heart."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.484,
   "end": 41.144,
   "text": "Absolutely."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.565,
   "end": 45.547,
   "text": "It took a lot of prayer, to be honest."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.767,
   "end": 46.807,
   "text": "It took a lot of prayer."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.308,
   "end": 48.488,
   "text": "It took a lot of journaling."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.748,
   "end": 49.649,
   "text": "It took a lot of..."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.108,
   "end": 57.032,
   "text": "just working through the pain and hurt and the anger even."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.893,
   "end": 62.655,
   "text": "I know as a child, I was like, you're not supposed to get angry."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.055,
   "end": 65.597,
   "text": "You know, I was always told anger is a bad thing."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.937,
   "end": 69.839,
   "text": "So then I was like, you sort through that and not get angry."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.279,
   "end": 79.024,
   "text": "So then journaling was my outlet to express the anger and the hurt and all of the feelings that you're not allowed to have."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.819,
   "end": 80.139,
   "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.28,
   "end": 82.1,
   "text": "So, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.32,
   "end": 95.547,
   "text": "So I just want people to be able to know that they can express their self in that outlet and feel safe and heard and understood in a safe environment that they can create for their selves."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.167,
   "end": 98.288,
   "text": "It doesn't have to be anybody else make it for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.308,
   "end": 99.648,
   "text": "You can make it for yourself."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.39,
   "end": 103.65,
   "text": "Safe, heard."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.751,
   "end": 105.411,
   "text": "And understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.431,
   "end": 106.892,
   "text": "And understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.207,
   "end": 111.728,
   "text": "That's deep."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.029,
   "end": 117.835,
   "text": "Now, I know you said it took a lot of journaling, a lot of prayer."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.816,
   "end": 124.402,
   "text": "Was there a someone or something that inspired, encouraged, or motivated you along this journey?"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.442,
   "end": 130.008,
   "text": "I know you said you dove into self-help, podcasts, and YouTube."
  },
  {
   "start": 131.19,
   "end": 131.27,
   "text": "Any"
  }
 ],
